these options automatically.

00:08:36.216 --> 00:08:38.049
I didn't really know
anything about finance,

00:08:38.049 --> 00:08:39.070
but then I learned.

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:41.530
I learned that you could
price a binary option.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:42.780
I just went to Wikipedia.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.075
You could Google binary option.

00:08:44.075 --> 00:08:46.510
And there's something
called a Black-Scholes motto

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:48.280
that you can you
input your numbers

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:51.160
and then have a guesstimate
on how much it would cost.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.960
And usually it would
be pretty accurate.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:56.360
So we did that for a
couple of months I think.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.690
And it was actually
a really basic bot.

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:00.260
