errors or whatever.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.580
It was pretty shit.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.120
But I still did it.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:11.020
And we still made money-ish.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.990
So then now I had a pretty
good fundamental knowledge

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:17.650
