to facilitate your trading.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.140
I basically wrote
some VBA macros

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:34.990
to facilitate in our
pricing of the assets

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.190
so that we could trade.

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:39.969
I did really well on a case
that was the options case.

00:09:39.969 --> 00:09:41.260
